<Layout title="Enquiry privacy"><section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">ENQUIRY PRIVACY · DRAFT</p><h1>Your enquiry,<br/><em>handled thoughtfully.</em></h1></section><section class="section prose"><p>This form collects a parent or carer’s name, email, optional phone number, a child’s age range and an enquiry message so the tutoring service can respond about tutoring.</p><p>When enabled, enquiries are emailed through Resend. Cloudflare hosts the website and Turnstile checks submissions to reduce spam. This website does not write enquiries to a website database.</p><p>Please avoid sharing sensitive information about children. Before launch, the service must provide its legal business identity, privacy contact, lawful basis, retention period, applicable processor information and rights procedure in a final privacy notice.</p><p class="notice">This is draft information for review. The online form is unavailable until the email and spam protection settings are configured.</p></section></Layout>
